WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.267
Okay,

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.300
a number series!

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:10.967
Two,

00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:11.633
four,

00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:12.300
seven,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:12.967
eleven,

00:00:12.967 --> 00:00:13.633
sixteen,

00:00:13.633 --> 00:00:15.000
and then...

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
what comes next?

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.667
A.

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:18.367
Twenty-one,

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:19.033
B.

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:19.700
Twenty,

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.367
C.

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:21.033
Twenty-three,

00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:22.400
or D.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.067
Twenty-two?

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:24.400
Five seconds!

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.400
TIME'S UP!

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:33.867
The answer is...

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:34.467
D,

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:35.067
twenty-two!

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:38.033
The gaps grow by one:

00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:39.233
plus two,

00:00:39.233 --> 00:00:39.833
three,

00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:40.433
four,

00:00:40.433 --> 00:00:41.033
five,

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:42.800
then plus six.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:46.400
So sixteen plus six is twenty-two.

00:00:47.533 --> 00:00:47.933
So,

00:00:47.933 --> 00:00:49.967
are you smart or fart?

00:00:49.967 --> 00:00:52.400
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.600
find your rank!

00:00:54.767 --> 00:00:55.100
So,

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.500
how did you do?

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.867
Comment your score below,

00:00:57.867 --> 00:00:59.233
and follow for more!
